# Jak 1: presses that land between the frame's first read and the read again before Jak ("late")
# reach the pools before his a frame later, once: a jump, then circle at Keira (her talk starts),
# then start (the game pauses and stays paused). Jak near the hut walls for the shadows.
0 wait *target* target-title-wait
200 continue village1-hut
201 wait *target* target-continue
202 wait *target* target-stance
240 teleport assistant 0 0
241 wait *target* target-stance
280 pstate assistant
280 pos *target*
300 x
304 -
305 wait *target* target-stance
306 circle late
307 print *cpad-reread-down*
309 -
310 pstate assistant
311 pos *target*
330 pstate assistant
400 pstate assistant
460 exit
